      "player": "Opus Valley",
      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "OK! Opponent played Bloodthorn Flail and Moonshadow (1/1 with 6 -1/-1 counters, menace, summoning sick). They skipped attack, which means Moonshadow can't attack yet. They have 2 cards left in hand and Bloodghast still in graveyard.\n\nMy hand: Winternight Stories, Insatiable Avarice, Watery Grave, Archenemy's Charm\nMy board: 5 untapped lands (Swamp, 2x Gloomlake Verge, Watery Grave, Restless Reef)\n\nLet me check Archenemy's Charm:",
